## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# Clone repo
git clone https://github.com/DanielEnriq/LockInVowe.git
cd LockInVowe

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Set up local env
vercel env pull .env.local --yes

# Run development server
npm run dev

# Open browser
http://localhost:3000
```

